Z||000003||82-T/A||11-25-2000||03:33 PM||||Hey, hows it going.. it's actually pretty easy.<P><BR>what you need to do is this..<P><BR>"[IMG]"  and then "[/IMG]"<P>I hope that comes out.. it's UBB code. <P>You'll need to have the first one... THEN the link to the picture, and then that last thing listed. <P>There should be no spaces, and no "s... I just put those there so it would show up.<P>Todd||||reg||1
